I am in the airport.
The airport is big.
There are many people here.
I walk to the baggage.
I see many, many suitcases.
A suitcase is small.
A suitcase is grey.
Where is my suitcase?
Ah, there it is!
I see my suitcase now.
My suitcase is big and red.
I take my suitcase.
I am tired.
But I am also happy.
